{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates C++ code to Python 3 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following GNU C++11 code to Python 3 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original GNU C++11 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\n#include <bits/stdc++.h>\n//\nusing namespace std;\nconst int INF = 0x3f3f3f3f;\nconst int maxm = 2000015;\nconst int maxn = 105*55;\nint n, m, c, d, k;\ninline int read()\n{\n    int x=0,f=1;char ch=getchar();\n    while (ch<'0'||ch>'9'){if (ch=='-') f=-1;ch=getchar();}\n    while (ch>='0'&&ch<='9'){x=x*10+ch-'0';ch=getchar();}\n    return x*f;\n}\nstruct Edge\n{\n    int to, next, cap, flow, cost;\n}edge[maxm];\nint head[maxn], tol;\nint pre[maxn], dis[maxn];\nbool vis[maxn];\nint N ;\nvoid init(int n)\n{\n    N = n;\n    tol = 0;\n    memset(head, -1, sizeof(head));\n}\nvoid addedge(int u, int v, int cap, int cost)\n{\n    edge[tol].to = v;\n    edge[tol].cap = cap;\n    edge[tol].cost = cost;\n    edge[tol].flow = 0;\n    edge[tol].next = head[u];\n    head[u] = tol++;\n    edge[tol].to = u;\n    edge[tol].cap = 0;\n    edge[tol].cost = -cost;\n    edge[tol].flow = 0;\n    edge[tol].next = head[v];\n    head[v] = tol++;\n}\nbool spfa(int s, int t)\n{\n    queue<int>q;\n    for(int i = 0; i < N; i++)\n    {\n        dis[i] = INF;\n        vis[i] = false;\n        pre[i] = -1;\n    }\n    dis[s] = 0;\n    vis[s] = true;\n    q.push(s);\n    while(!q.empty())\n    {\n        int u = q.front();\n        q.pop();\n        vis[u] = false;\n        for(int i = head[u]; i != -1; i = edge[i].next)\n        {\n            int v = edge[i].to;\n            if(edge[i].cap > edge[i].flow && dis[v] > dis[u] + edge[i].cost)\n            {\n                dis[v] = dis[u] + edge[i].cost;\n                pre[v] = i;\n                if(!vis[v])\n                {\n                    vis[v] = true;\n                    q.push(v);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    if(pre[t] == -1) return false;\n    else return true;\n}\nint minCostMaxflow(int s, int t, int &cost)\n{\n    int flow = 0;\n    cost = 0;\n    while(spfa(s,t))\n    {\n        int Min = INF;\n        for(int i = pre[t]; i != -1; i = pre[edge[i^1].to])\n        {\n            if(Min > edge[i].cap - edge[i].flow)\n                Min = edge[i].cap - edge[i].flow;\n        }\n        for(int i = pre[t]; i != -1; i = pre[edge[i^1].to])\n        {\n            edge[i].flow += Min;\n            edge[i^1].flow -= Min;\n            cost +=  edge[i].cost*Min;\n        }\n        flow += Min;\n    }\n    return flow;\n}\nint point(int x, int y){\n    return (x-1)*50+y;\n}\nint main(){\n    int S = 101*55, T = S + 1;\n    n = read(), m = read(), k = read(), c = read(), d = read();\n    int tmp;\n    init(T+1);\n    for(int i = 1; i <= k; i++){\n        tmp = read();\n        addedge(S, tmp, 1, 0);\n    }\n    for(int i = 1; i <= 50; i++){\n        for(int j = 1; j <= 103; j++){\n            int x = point(j, i);\n            int y = point(j+1, i);\n            addedge(x, y, INF, c);\n        }\n    }\n    for(int i = 0; i < 102; i++){\n        int tmp = i*50+1;\n        addedge(tmp, T, INF, 0);\n    }\n    for(int i = 1; i <= m; i++){\n        int u, v;\n        u = read(), v = read();\n        for(int j = 1; j <= 102; j++){\n            int x = point(j, u), x1 = point(j+1, u);\n            int y1 = point(j+1, v), y = point(j, v);\n            for(int k = 0; k < 50; k++){\n                int val = d*(k*2+1)+c;\n                addedge(x, y1, 1, val);\n                addedge(y, x1, 1, val);\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    int cost = 0;\n    minCostMaxflow(S, T, cost);\n    cout << cost << endl;\n    return 0;\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport sys\nfrom collections import deque\n\nINF = 0x3f3f3f3f\nmaxm = 2000015\nmaxn = 105 * 55\n\nclass Edge:\n    def __init__(self, to, next_edge, cap, flow, cost):\n        self.to = to\n        self.next = next_edge\n        self.cap = cap\n        self.flow = flow\n        self.cost = cost\n\ndef read():\n    data = []\n    while True:\n        try:\n            line = input().strip()\n            if line:\n                data.extend(line.split())\n        except EOFError:\n            break\n    idx = 0\n    def next_int():\n        nonlocal idx\n        val = int(data[idx])\n        idx += 1\n        return val\n    return next_int\n\ndef main():\n    n = read()\n    m = read()\n    k = read()\n    c = read()\n    d = read()\n    \n    S = 101 * 55\n    T = S + 1\n    \n    # Initialize graph\n    head = [-1] * (T + 2)\n    edge = []\n    tol = 0\n    \n    def init(n):\n        nonlocal tol, head, edge\n        tol = 0\n        head = [-1] * (n + 1)\n        edge = []\n    \n    def addedge(u, v, cap, cost):\n        nonlocal tol\n        # Forward edge\n        edge.append(Edge(v, head[u], cap, 0, cost))\n        head[u] = tol\n        tol += 1\n        # Backward edge\n        edge.append(Edge(u, head[v], 0, 0, -cost))\n        head[v] = tol\n        tol += 1\n    \n    def point(x, y):\n        return (x - 1) * 50 + y\n    \n    init(T + 1)\n    \n    # Add edges from source to k points\n    for _ in range(k):\n        tmp = read()\n        addedge(S, tmp, 1, 0)\n    \n    # Horizontal edges\n    for i in range(1, 51):\n        for j in range(1, 104):\n            x = point(j, i)\n            y = point(j + 1, i)\n            addedge(x, y, INF, c)\n    \n    # Edges to sink\n    for i in range(102):\n        tmp = i * 50 + 1\n        addedge(tmp, T, INF, 0)\n    \n    # Cross edges\n    for _ in range(m):\n        u = read()\n        v = read()\n        for j in range(1, 103):\n            x = point(j, u)\n            x1 = point(j + 1, u)\n            y1 = point(j + 1, v)\n            y = point(j, v)\n            for k_val in range(50):\n                val = d * (k_val * 2 + 1) + c\n                addedge(x, y1, 1, val)\n                addedge(y, x1, 1, val)\n    \n    # SPFA implementation\n    def spfa(s, t):\n        nonlocal dis, vis, pre\n        dis = [INF] * (N + 1)\n        vis = [False] * (N + 1)\n        pre = [-1] * (N + 1)\n        \n        dis[s] = 0\n        vis[s] = True\n        q = deque([s])\n        \n        while q:\n            u = q.popleft()\n            vis[u] = False\n            i = head[u]\n            while i != -1:\n                v = edge[i].to\n                if edge[i].cap > edge[i].flow and dis[v] > dis[u] + edge[i].cost:\n                    dis[v] = dis[u] + edge[i].cost\n                    pre[v] = i\n                    if not vis[v]:\n                        vis[v] = True\n                        q.append(v)\n                i = edge[i].next\n        \n        return pre[t] != -1\n    \n    def minCostMaxflow(s, t):\n        nonlocal N, dis, vis, pre\n        flow = 0\n        cost = 0\n        \n        while spfa(s, t):\n            Min = INF\n            i = pre[t]\n            while i != -1:\n                Min = min(Min, edge[i].cap - edge[i].flow)\n                i = pre[edge[i ^ 1].to]\n            \n            i = pre[t]\n            while i != -1:\n                edge[i].flow += Min\n                edge[i ^ 1].flow -= Min\n                cost += edge[i].cost * Min\n                i = pre[edge[i ^ 1].to]\n            \n            flow += Min\n        \n        return flow\n    \n    N = T + 1\n    cost = 0\n    minCostMaxflow(S, T)\n    print(cost)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.85\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.0001746263587847352, -9.536738616588991e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.00035065223346464336, -0.0006429274217225611, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -0.0006294653285294771, -0.00025054652360267937, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -0.0001820160250645131, -0.0013302058214321733, -0.050376273691654205, -7.152555099310121e-07, -0.00044610086479224265, -6.198863957251888e-06, -2.861018856492592e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -3.564294092939235e-05, 0.0, -7.152555099310121e-07, -5.125986263010418e-06, -4.768370445162873e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, -0.026302536949515343, -0.000324673397699371, -1.5497195136049413e-06, -3.933898824470816e-06, 0.0, -4.768370445162873e-07, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -2.622600959512056e-06, -4.768370445162873e-07, 0.0, -3.576278118089249e-07, -6.556489552167477e-06, -3.814689989667386e-06, -2.264974000354414e-06, -5.960462772236497e-07, -6.198863957251888e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -4.768370445162873e-07, -0.018149960786104202, 0.0, -7.152555099310121e-07, 0.0, -0.16051310300827026, -0.42267829179763794, -9.202533692587167e-05, -2.50339189733495e-06, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.42870157957077026, -3.4570634852570947e-06, -8.344646857949556e-07, -7.152555099310121e-07, -3.576278118089249e-07, -0.17974574863910675, -2.50339189733495e-06, -0.07298173755407333, -0.0017441788222640753, -0.6125029921531677, -1.5020257706055418e-05, -3.814689989667386e-06, -7.152555099310121e-07, -0.3134266138076782, -1.1444026313256472e-05, -8.344646857949556e-07, -1.7881377516459906e-06, -4.887569048150908e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -2.3841855067985307e-07, 0.0, -3.576278118089249e-07, -9.536738616588991e-07, -1.4305104514278355e-06, -3.576278118089249e-07, -2.98022769129602